      "description": "The Merewardens suspect the Choir is made from people taken from the border settlements, while Amber's council insists the reports are fabricated. If the cities cannot agree on who the enemy is, their alliance may fracture before the next attack.",
      "faction_ids": ["fac_merewardens", "fac_amber_council", "fac_ashen_choir"]
    },
    {
