      "name": "The Last Furnace Fuel",
      "description": "Cinderhold's failing furnaces can strengthen the valley's defenses or forge weapons for a counterattack, but not both. Its clans must decide whether to disclose their dwindling reserves and risk losing leverage over the alliance.",
      "faction_ids": ["fac_cinder_clans", "fac_amber_council"]
    }
  ]
}

